  "title": "ERF: trigger reload when writing non-ERF encap",
  "description": "Set `wdh->needs_reload = TRUE` right in `erf_dump_open()` if we know\nwe're converting a non-ERF file to ERF. Fixes the edge case of\nconverting short capture files to ERF causing a crash.\n\nCloses #17989",
